{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a56abafedbd4195ba66e0c7396e74683fb396ae8a2a21739b384a26f426a02d3","ja":"ライブ直前のサプライズ","zh":"演出开始前的惊喜","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f5591ba119c8c9635d18e4d74c9f172b477aff9af0ee8944d3ce71acb88f9583","ja":"今日のお仕事は、路上ゲリラライブ。\n本番前に、4人が控室で待機していると……","zh":"今天的工作是街头游击Live。\n正式开演前，4个人在休息室等待时……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"95c50f537334a691351c02329fb03e39b162dfd9118ad0bafd74bf3a87462b00","ja":"……うわっ、なんか兄ちゃんたちから\nいっぱい連絡きてる！？　えーっと……ええ～っ！？","zh":"……哇，哥哥他们怎么发了\n好多消息过来！？　那个……诶诶～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"66058fe1683d9761f5dcda0d0fc8be9e0ac41ecceb9760265bc2e9f54d39ba8c","ja":"「このへんにいれば昴たちよく見えるよな？」\n「絶賛待機中！」「ライブ頑張れよ」……だって。","zh":"“在这里的话应该能看清楚昂她们吧？”\n“正在全力待机中！”“演出要加油啊”……之类的话。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"463becb47ffab827fa5edc6a63fa982d9993643e09f0b85ee86cb7abc0c41791","ja":"なんと。\nみなさん、応援に来てくださったのですね。","zh":"哎呀。\n大家都来为我加油了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"182617b52ca2292ea02c486ece139130fb86fe2d466ab80d9c159ac32f86787c","ja":"いや、でもオレ、今日のこと何も言ってないぜ！？\nゲリラライブだから、秘密にしとこーって思って……。","zh":"不对，可是我今天的事什么都还没说啊！？\n因为是突袭演出，本来还想保密的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f476fe2337569e7cc8d15a038d868c871af49bf76273941afa953766a76681fe","ja":"事務所に問い合わせたのでしょうか？\n……おや？　私にも、何やら連絡が。","zh":"是向事务所询问了吗？\n……哎呀？我也收到了什么联络呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"fd73c63ec52240f3ea748c1f658fe046876759a3f58b925724ff6a3487bb963b","ja":"……ダブルサプライズ。私も隠していたのですが、\n父のところの事務員さんが、来てくれるそうです。","zh":"……双重惊喜。其实我也瞒着大家，\n我父亲那边的事务员好像要过来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ed071e8e05298105a8f781fff8a5b4ef93f8537adf4544a30e937fa1298c8c90","ja":"なんかコソコソしとるな～って、\nバレてもうてたんかな～……あれっ？","zh":"总觉得鬼鬼祟祟的～这样子，\n难道已经被发现了吗～……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f7ba2c62ea11dab96a743c57d675ab9550f921a5f4a68ee7a882b6231fa7f39e","ja":"私もなんか連絡きた……はあっ！？\nアニキもおるって！　昴んとこと合流したって！？","zh":"我也收到消息了……哈啊！？\n说是大哥也在！还跟昴汇合了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"022b04f533f377d561859f5abadb332489e0ff6a515a39001aa96addae9f4b22","ja":"ええっ、すごい！\nなんだか家族参観って感じだね。","zh":"诶，好厉害！\n感觉就像是家庭公开课一样呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ea3ebf68cce0aac2663e73df2b778d2ede9e552e8d27a9049c00bd615f746a87","ja":"いやあ、雪歩も他人事やないで？\nこの流れ……雪歩のお父さんも来るフラグちゃう？","zh":"哎呀，雪步也不能置身事外吧？\n照这个势头……雪步的爸爸说不定也立下要来的Flag了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ef78b5d48b2abcb5157c0cc3aa2bc68d0dc6a0f673d845ee232303c0ca5881d0","ja":"まさかそんな、フラグなんて……。\nあっ、メッセージ……。","zh":"怎么可能，立什么flag啊……\n啊，有新消息……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1603.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c67f4650092d491e27269749fe81268c948de29c0d2d2bec98e55fb4e34437be","ja":"……えっ！？\nお、お母さんが来たって……！？","zh":"……诶！？\n妈妈来了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
